Z||000000||TopFiero||08-31-2001||12:14 PM||||  Just curious to know if Paul Heindselman, Peter Zurich, Scott Backer, Doug Chase, Dave Mack, or any other old Fiero Mailing List members might still be out there (circa 1993-1998).||||reg||1
