Z||000012||mrfiero||12-31-2001||06:13 PM||||I was on the fiero.org list for several years.....up until 1999 or so.  It seemed like it went downhill fast and I just lost interest.<P>That's about when I found this forum and have been here exclusively since.<P>Nice to hear that a few guys are still around.  Like Doug Chase....how's it going?  The last time I saw you was when you were trekking through Colorado a few years ago in your Formula.<P>Anyways.....I think Pennock's Forum is more fun than a mailing list (besides......you don't get 100+ e-mails a day!).||||reg||1
